Pick $\delta \in (0,1)$ and choose
\begin{equation*}
    \varphi_{t} = 2 \log(2 t^2 \pi^2 / (3\delta))
    + 2 \log\left(t^2 \right)
    \in O(\log t)\,.
\end{equation*}
With high probability $1 - \delta$ and for any $T \geq 1$,
\begin{equation*}
    \regret(T) = O \left(\sqrt{\gamma_{T}T \log T}\right)\,.
\end{equation*}
Here $\gamma_{T}$ is short for $\gamma_{T}(k_{d}+k_{c})$.
